  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2000-06-14T00:00:00Z\"\u003e14 June 2000\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Helen Clark thanks Bob Harvey \n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Helen Clark\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Prime Minister\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Bob stepped in at short notice last year after Michael Hirschfeld\u0026#39;s tragic death.  He dedicated himself to our election campaign and fundraising.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I thank Bob for his contribution and wish him well for his continuing work as Mayor of Waitakere City,\u0026#34; Helen Clark said.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "\"Bob stepped in at short notice last year after Michael Hirschfeld's tragic death. He dedicated himself to our election campaign and fundraising. \"I thank Bob for his contribution and wish him well for his continuing work as Mayor of Waitakere City,\" Helen Clark said.",
